cenote: configs, launchers, test harness, results and notes for running open models locally on Windows.

This repository contains no engine or model code of its own beyond its scripts. The engines are included as git
submodules under engines/ and keep their own licenses and notices:

- engines/xolotl   Xolotl by Indras Mirror, https://github.com/Indras-Mirror/Xolotl (MIT)
- engines/strata   Strata by Niko1221, https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata (MIT)
- engines/maya     Project Maya by mw00, https://github.com/mw00/project-maya (MIT)

All three build on ggml / llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp, MIT).

The configs refer to model files that are not part of this repository and keep the licenses on their model cards:
DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 (DeepSeek), lxe's dsx 2-bit quant, IndrasMirror's 1017 XQ files, GLM-5.3-Flash (Zhipu AI),
peasantsmith's Maya quants, Qwen3.8-Flash-Next (Qwen), Swift 1.5 (UkisAI, Swift Open License 1.0) and SC117's
abliterated Swift.

The Windows port of Xolotl's DeepSeek-V4.1 engine and the routing work described in README.md were contributed
upstream to Xolotl (pull requests #10 and #11) under Xolotl's MIT license.
